  "name": "TestSystemTestGoalDoesNotUseForeach",
  "comment": "Structural guard against the silent-skip regression that motivated this\nrewrite: the foreach-based runner skipped tests when one errored. The\nreplacement uses test.run (a C# loop). Assert system/test.goal contains\nno 'foreach' — a regression that reverted to the foreach loop would fail.",
